#tr.en: will acquire, Nākimum has no claim;

3'. a-na _a-sza3 u3 {gesz}kiri6 u3 e2_ isz-qu2-lu
#tr.ts: ana eqlim u kirîm u bītim išqulū
#tr.en: they paid for the field, the orchard and the house.

4'. _igi_ mu-da-du-um _dumu_ usz-tasz-ni-dingir
#tr.ts: maḫar mudādum mār uštašni-ilum
#tr.en: Before Mudādum son of Uštašni-ilum;

5'. _igi_ a-bi-lu-s,u2 _dumu_ li-pi2-it-sin
#tr.ts: maḫar abī-luṣu mār lipit-sîn
#tr.en: before Abi-luṣu son of Lipit-sîn;

6'. _igi_ ip-qu2-sza _dumu_ a-pa-t,a3-bu-um
#tr.ts: maḫar ipquša mār abum-ṭābum
#tr.en: before Ipquša son of Abum-ṭābum;

7'. _igi_ an-ni-dingir _dumu_ sin-tu-kul2-ti
#tr.ts: maḫar anni-ilum mār sîn-tukultī
#tī.en: before Anni-ilum son of Sîn-tukultī;

8'. _igi_ sin-pu-ut,-ra-am _dumu_ su-ka-li-ia
#tr.ts: maḫar sîn-puṭram mār su(k)ka(l)līya
#tr.en: before Sîn-puṭram son of Sukkakllīya;

9'. _igi_ a-pi2-li-ia _dumu_ sze-er-sze-ru-um
#tr.ts: maḫar apilīya mār šerše(r)rum
#tr.en: before Apilīya son of Šeršerrum;

10'. _igi_ pa-ar-ga-nu-um _dumu_ a-sa3-ru-um
#tr.ts: maḫar parganûm mār azarum
#tr.en: before Paraganûm son of Azarum;

11'. _igi_ i-na-szu-dingir _dumu_ nu-ur2-{d}utu
#tr.ts: maḫar ina-qāt-ilim mār nūr-šamaš
#tr.en: before Ina-qāt-ilim son of Nūr-šamaš;

12'. _igi_ ip-qa-tum _dumu_ hat,-t,i3-im
#tr.ts: maḫar ipqatum mār ḫaṭṭim
#tr.en: before Ipqatum son of Ḫaṭṭim;

13'. _igi_ tu-tu-na-s,ir _aga-us2_ sza szar-ri-im
#tr.ts: maḫar tutu-nāṣir rēdîm ša šarrim
#tr.en: before Tutu-nāṣir soldier of the king;

14'. _igi_ sin-dingir _dumu_ ku-da-nu-um
#tr.ts: maḫar sîn-ilum mār kūdanum
#tr.en: before Sîn-ilum son of Kūdanum.

15'. _mu_ a-pil-sin u2-ga-li-bu
#tr.ts: šanat apil-sîn uga(l)libu
#tr.en: The year: "Apil-sîn shaved".

@seal 1
